  {
   "n": 8,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>If conventional AM modulation technique is replaced with DSB-SC, the % power saving is ‘<em>x</em>’. If conventional AM modulation technique is replaced with SSB, the % power saving is ‘<em>y</em>’. The ratio <img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/d2/d25ad000507df5c0d41c.png\" /> if modulation index of AM signal is 0.5 is _________. (Rounded off to 2 decimal places)</p>",
